%% title: PSD2 XS2A API Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant TPP as TPP (AISP/PISP)
    participant PSD2 as PSD2Service
    participant TPPReg as TPP Registry
    participant ConsentSvc as Consent Service
    participant AccountSvc as Account Service
    participant PaymentSvc as Payment Service
    participant Outbox as PSD2 Outbox
    participant Kafka

    TPP->>PSD2: GET /api/v1/accounts (QWAC mTLS, Bearer token)
    PSD2->>TPPReg: verify TPP certificate & role (AISP)
    TPPReg-->>PSD2: TPP valid, roles=[AISP]
    PSD2->>ConsentSvc: GET /api/v1/consents?grantee_id={tpp_id}&scope=accounts
    ConsentSvc-->>PSD2: active consent with account IBANs
    PSD2->>AccountSvc: GET /api/v1/accounts?ibans={...}
    AccountSvc-->>PSD2: account list
    PSD2-->>TPP: 200 OK (account list, X-Request-Id)

    TPP->>PSD2: POST /api/v1/payments/sepa-credit-transfers (PISP)
    PSD2->>TPPReg: verify TPP role (PISP)
    TPPReg-->>PSD2: TPP valid, roles=[PISP]
    PSD2->>ConsentSvc: verify payment consent & SCA
    ConsentSvc-->>PSD2: consent active
    PSD2->>PaymentSvc: POST /api/v1/payments (amount, creditor_iban)
    PaymentSvc-->>PSD2: payment_id, status=RECEIVED
    PSD2->>Outbox: INSERT psd2_outbox (PAYMENT_INITIATED)
    Outbox->>Kafka: publish PAYMENT_INITIATED
    PSD2-->>TPP: 201 Created (payment_id, _links)
